      "writtenOn": "2017-03-17T01:14:35Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "I think this call can be removed altogether. The value of Rp that the DUT port presents only changes based on updates to the CHG port. This means board_manage_dut_port() is only called from CHG port, which makes sense because the actions in that function fully depend on changes to the CHG vbus state and the DUT port PD contract would never be present at the time that vbus is being enabled.",
